{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1234911-investigation-how-to-do-pro-forma-investigation-when-you-allready-know-the-truth","id":1234911,"title":"Investigation: How to do Pro forma investigation when you Allready know the truth.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-07-14T04:47:39-07:00","id":1234911,"title":"Investigation: How to do Pro forma investigation when you Allready know the truth.","content":"If your a Private Investigator, Police officer, or lawyer.<br /> <br /> How are attempts to Find <i>admissable </i>evidence affected by Auspex, Psychic abilities, Mage magics, etc<br /> <br /> When you allready <b>know </b>the truth, but need to find <b>mundane </b>evidence of it?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-14T13:56:45-07:00","id":1235078,"title":"","content":"Other people will probably offer good answers and approaches. It wouldn't be easy, but not all of it is impossible-look at some of the solutions that Jessica Jones went through in her attempt to get Hope Chapman off the charge in the Netflix series bearing her name. With some work from the organizations that are interested in balancing the quo, such as Barrett, VASCU, and the edges of Valkyrie, a legally set action is possible in some circumstances.<br /> <br /> But I'm gonna point out the clear opposite as my point-sometimes, you just <i>can't</i>. The law as most governments enact are predicated on the sense that ignoring the supernatural is the greatest effect of minimizing it, and therefore lacks every precedent and antecedent for legally investigating, prosecuting, and responding to.<br /> <br /> The law fails, but justice demands. What do you do?<br /> <br /> Welcome to the Chronicles.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-14T15:21:48-07:00","id":1235089,"title":"","content":"do you think bonus dice or two is appropriate as you have a good idea what your looking for?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-14T23:45:53-07:00","id":1235202,"title":"","content":"If you know the truth, it is a matter of where to look, not what to look for. Depending on your tools, yes that would help a lot, far beyond bonus dice - asking the right question with Mimir's Wisdom or Auspex can easily lead you to your goal of e.g. The murder weapon.<br /> Look at a number of cheesy crime series, they occasionally approach a case this way.<br /> Keep in Mind though that in the ChroD, sometimes there simply is no admissable evidence, as Arcane pointed out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T03:37:57-07:00","id":1235230,"title":"","content":"Kind hard to prove foul play when the body was <i>Eaten</i> or dumped into Twilight. Or when &quot;I was possessed&quot; is generally not acceptable as a defense.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T04:29:16-07:00","id":1235238,"title":"","content":"Use the normal investigation system, but treat the truth as your first clue (gives you a good idea of where to look for what would normally be clues) evidence that rules out other possibilities as the subsequent clues, and the proof of what did happen as the solution.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T13:10:56-07:00","id":1235317,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1234911-investigation-how-to-do-pro-forma-investigation-when-you-allready-know-the-truth?p=1235230#post1235230\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Kind hard to prove foul play when the body was <i>Eaten</i> or dumped into Twilight. Or when &quot;I was possessed&quot; is generally not acceptable as a defense.</div> </div> </div> </div>People have been convicted with devoured victims before, and extenuating circumstances can be reframed when played right. Sure, no one wants to hear &quot;possession&quot; but they might buy &quot;I was drugged and manipulated while impaired&quot; if the rest of it can keep up the plausibility.<br /> <br /> I assume the end goal of these types of characters is to get some kind of legal recourse rather than simply getting to the truth and/or enacting punishment regardless of the systems of law at work.<br /> <br /> A big part of the task is really not getting the evidence to be admissiable, but to paint a picture of plausible enough accountability out of the surrounding context that the end results are punished and the means aren't too closely questioned.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T13:46:39-07:00","id":1235325,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1234911-investigation-how-to-do-pro-forma-investigation-when-you-allready-know-the-truth?p=1235317#post1235317\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I assume the end goal of these types of characters is to get some kind of legal recourse rather than simply getting to the truth and/or enacting punishment regardless of the systems of law at work.<br /> <br /> A big part of the task is really not getting the evidence to be admissiable, but to paint a picture of plausible enough accountability out of the surrounding context that the end results are punished and the means aren't too closely questioned.</div> </div> </div> </div>That actually sounds like a decent concept for organization - &quot;give us the evidence/story, and we'll translate it into 'normal' for the masses.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T13:55:33-07:00","id":1235329,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 